From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:02:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 070/220] [ae-patch] Show native Codex questions inline in
 Claude's question form

The Codex card opened a modal dialog with its own buttons, unlike Claude's
inline AskUserQuestionForm, and Transcript kept every question that had no
exact "Answer to Codex questions" reply, so a plain chat reply left full-width
"Answer Codex questions" buttons behind. CodexQuestionCard now renders inline
with AskUserQuestionForm, disabled while the answer sends; Cancel folds it to a
"Show Codex's question" link. Only the newest question that no real user
message (committed or still sending) has followed stays pending, a newer
question supersedes older ones even without an item id, and a system notice
does not retire it. The answer is still one normal user message, with line
breaks in an answer folded to spaces.
